    "english": {
      "headingRaw": "Five-character-ancient-verseLiuZongyuanDWELLINGBYASTREAM",
      "translationRaw": "IhadsolongbeentroubledbyofficialhatandrobeThatIamgladtobeanexilehereinthiswildsouthland。Iamaneighbournowofplantersandreapers。Iamaguestofthemountainsandwoods。Iploughinthemorning，turningdewygrasses，Andateveningtiemyfisher-boat，breakingthequietstream。BackandforthIgo，scarcelymeetinganyone，Andsingalongpoemandgazeatthebluesky。",
